MODULE: CheckpointWithinAppliedCrashPublishesMemory
TARGET: CheckpointWithinApplied
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reactivated maintainer publishes its lost in-memory progress instead of the persisted applied offsets
PERTURBS: Crash

--- FIND
    /\ pubTree' = bound /\ pubPos' = ckpt
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ pubTree' = bound /\ pubPos' = applied
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
--- END
